    <tr><td><code>StartEvent</code></td><td>Pydantic model</td><td>events.py</td><td>Emitted when a run begins — contains run_id, list of agents, and total expected steps.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>ProgressUpdateEvent</code></td><td>Pydantic model</td><td>events.py</td><td>Emitted after each agent completes — agent name, status, intermediate results.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>CompleteEvent</code></td><td>Pydantic model</td><td>events.py</td><td>Final event — contains aggregated portfolio recommendation and all agent outputs.</td></tr>
