    <tr><td><code>API_KEY_ENCRYPTION_KEY</code></td><td>Auto-generated</td><td>Fernet encryption key for securing stored API keys. Persisted in <code>.env</code>.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>OLLAMA_BASE_URL</code></td><td><code>http://localhost:11434</code></td><td>Base URL for the local Ollama API server.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SSE_HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL</code></td><td><code>15</code> (seconds)</td><td>Interval between SSE keepalive comments to prevent proxy timeouts.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SQLITE_BUSY_TIMEOUT</code></td><td><code>5000</code> (ms)</td><td>How long SQLite waits for a write lock before returning SQLITE_BUSY.</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

